# Keep the wslc/docker build context small: the signaling-server Dockerfile
# (deploy/signaling/Dockerfile) only copies Cargo.toml + crates/ to compile
# prdt-signaling-server. Everything else (target/, .git, smoke/, .omc/, docs)
# is excluded so the context stays tiny and the build is fast.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
